  <item>
    <title>21. 城市孤勇者的自我照顾：三个习惯建立内心秩序</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68bd9b135faf3686597b74f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68bd9b135faf3686597b74f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 07 Sep 2025 14:50:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>周天夜晚，一个人站在寂寞的阳台，远眺着4公里外上海大厦和环球金融中心的蓝色轮廓，手机刷着热闹繁荣的朋友圈，你是否也感到一种难以言说的孤独？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期播客，分享给所有在一线城市努力生活，却时常感到内心荒芜的陌生的朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我从个人体验分享三个日常的向内探索的习惯：</span><strong><span>​跳舞、读史与写作</span></strong><span>。以及反思在不安隐隐动荡的环境里，它们如何帮我构建起坚实的内心秩序，在不确定的世界里，找到一份属于自己的确定。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>希望能给你传递一点点沉静的力量。</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 跳舞修身 - 熟习就是亘古不变规律</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="942">15:42</a> 读史修心 - 上帝视角驱动笃定选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1681">28:01</a> 写作修行 - 语言输出构建内在秩序</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Interlude</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Day One (Original Demo) - Hans Zimmer</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Ending Music</span></h2><span></span><p><span>如何 - 张悬</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/629c231ad25b25d66f837ab9/lsyrvARRzlh-i52VhH6d-NesMOGK.m4a" length="41786119" type="audio/mp4"/>
