  <item>
    <title>19.在上海会租房住得比买房快乐一百倍</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6775567815a5fd520e4c077a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6775567815a5fd520e4c077a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Jan 2025 14:55:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近看了《好东西》，有被两位女主在上海的家戳到！老房子虽旧但审美超好，居家场景白天阳光照进，夜色灯光温暖。但是，大美女在上海也得蜗居！在上海要住得区位方便、内部环境舒适，服务到位又体面真的太难了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期分享十年沪漂无数次租房心得经验，还有常见的租房误区和避雷指南。同是天涯沦落人，听到了就是好运💗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【这期你会听到】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> &nbsp;</span><em><strong><span>租住</span></strong></em><em><strong><span>又舒服又实惠的核心是扒出极致“性价比”房源</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> &nbsp;</span><em><strong><span>搜集足够多的房源信息来源是基础</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> </span><em><strong><span>伺机而动，租房也要预留一定的观望期</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">13:08</a> </span><em><strong><span>看房时考察人和考察房子一眼重要</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a> </span><em><strong><span>谈钱</span></strong></em><em><strong><span>不要忽略租金以外的隐形支出</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1765">29:25</a> </span><em><strong><span>搬家的痛苦才是租房的第一大障碍！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> </span><em><strong><span>动手</span></strong></em><em><strong><span>营造租房空间，坚定我“在”即是家</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2699">44:59</a> </span></strong><em><strong><span>动荡过渡期的短租选择和迷你仓库寄存家当</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2897">48:17</a> </span><em><strong><span>长租公寓和保障性租房</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM &amp; Ending Music】New Year’s Day - Taylor Swift</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvQZ-7C-LxDEWSaIxk1amxVwf9Yf.m4a" length="53291662" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnAj49NtB59-GG54xsD8bcAvJ5Up.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>19</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>18. 沪漂实录 | 留不下又离不开，这就是上海</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e7fcd53a5ff0a0cacea08c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e7fcd53a5ff0a0cacea08c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Sep 2024 09:39:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有的人会为了一个人而去一座城，而有的人会为了一座城而放弃一个人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我大概属于后者，而上海就是那座城。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但上海并不是一座能轻松立足的城市。求学、求职、求偶，在上海的竞争都是地狱级的激烈。在这里生活并不轻松，但又让我很难下定决心离开。就这样，我和上海相爱相杀来沪十余年。收入没从实习变首席，心境已从多巴胺少女熬成心如止水的老阿姨。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于上海，我可有太多可以分享——</span></p><span></span><p><span>【这期你会听到】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 大环境差，由无处不在的失业潮引发的留沪反思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">01:51</a> 初识上海 ，是文艺作品给无知少女编织的声色犬马的幻梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="282">04:42</a> 走访上海，发现本地人的生活其实很辛酸，群居在逼仄的巷弄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> 研究上海，看见黑色的标语赫然写满在老城区的墙上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">23:28</a> 融入上海，当成都妹子的“不拘小节”遭遇上海爷叔的“拿腔拿调”而产生身份焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1812">30:12</a> 生活在上海，吃面用勺我大为震惊，点菜想多问一句都战战兢兢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2232">37:12</a> 如果城市有MBTI，那它们刚好对立，上海是-STJ，成都是-NFP</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2472">41:12</a> 上海割裂的AB面，是平等地尊重和漠视所有人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 再看《繁花》，细品老上海一辈的骄傲与落寞</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Ending Music】City of Stars - Pier</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧我的两年前上海记忆的</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62cdc1f492f0689a31f4ffc8?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwNDhlMmM3ZTBmNWU3MjNiYmRkZmQ4MiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62cdc1f492f0689a31f4ffc8?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwNDhlMmM3ZTBmNWU3MjNiYmRkZmQ4MiJ9"><span>“沪漂逃亡记”</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🙋🏻这是一档沪漂女生在魔都生活的独立思考的播客，欢迎来我的小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65424562000000000d004fb3?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6019e8a6000000000100b049&amp;apptime=1726473182&amp;share_id=e97b0a556aaf4af6a1ef2357ceb50ad8" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65424562000000000d004fb3?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6019e8a6000000000100b049&amp;apptime=1726473182&amp;share_id=e97b0a556aaf4af6a1ef2357ceb50ad8"><span>【锐言】</span></a><span>找我</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>🎁看到最后，还有的彩蛋！找到了我十几年前在里弄画的第一个作业稚嫩的速写👇🏻</span></em></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><em><span>以及舞台剧《繁花》剧照（侵删）👇🏻</span></em></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpzVosqBpi89p1tsxeErW8xKi6Km.m4a" length="50752743" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftw-2VhkyHNHyrbfav74XcLeiuY_.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>18</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>17. 这几年还贷又租房的时光，究竟是错付了？P4</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66819322cdd230b23b4913a9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66819322cdd230b23b4913a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Jun 2024 17:17:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>贷款会成为压死三十岁的最后一根稻草吗？</span></p><p><span>上海潮湿又黏腻的梅雨季呀，浇灭了一切外出活动的可能🌂</span></p><p><span>所以就索性来录一期播客吧😊。</span></p><p><span>如果当下这个大环境下，你依然对</span><strong><span>一个普通女生如何独自在上海买房的经验</span></strong><span>感兴趣，欢迎收听【免责闲侃】系列前三期的前情介绍，有详细接地气的实操避坑指南，应该还没有过时。</span></p><p><span>🕑本期是后续，讲述了这几年还贷又租房的悲惨时光：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a> 好好还贷，让我带着镣铐继续沪漂……（哎）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="787">13:07</a> 好好租房，竟让老破小能多卖50万！？（伪）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a> 房子不是目的：不能从过程获得的幸福感都将幻灭</span></p><p><span>如果我的故事引起了你一点触动或者感到有价值，欢迎和我互动和链接。</span></p><p><span>【ED】雨天 - 孙燕姿</span></p><p><span>🎧我的【免责闲侃】买房经验前三期👇🏻：</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62bc9be11f317b0b2450f752" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62bc9be11f317b0b2450f752"><span>6. 免责闲侃 | 菜鸟社畜如何在上海高效买房 P1</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62d6892cfa15142e17251ccf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62d6892cfa15142e17251ccf"><span>8. 免责闲侃 | 当下普通青年的买房避坑经验 P2</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63e921b90d7e8eaa7278f4be" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63e921b90d7e8eaa7278f4be"><span>11. 免责闲侃 ｜ 买房经验的几点重要补丁 P3</span></a></p><p><span>👂🏻我常常在听的</span><strong><span>资产/房产类播客</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6388760f22567e8ea6ad070f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6388760f22567e8ea6ad070f"><span>面基</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61dd99a47b29652ff572257b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61dd99a47b29652ff572257b"><span>起高楼宴宾客</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6013f9f58e2f7ee375cf4216" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6013f9f58e2f7ee375cf4216"><span>知行小酒馆</span></a></p><p><span>订阅了NickNie的</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/HfhV_SwbUveSR_7pqSn-3A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/HfhV_SwbUveSR_7pqSn-3A"><span>【趋势动物】</span></a><span>小程序看房价走势（不是广）</span></p><p><span>🏠如果你对本期的</span><strong><span>租房空间</span></strong><span>营造也很有兴趣，也推荐你听这期播客：</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6645df63251bd96e6cc6a2dc?s=eyJ1IjoiNWU4NDNjYTBiZTBlNjQxODYyZDMwYzUzIiwiZCI6MX0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6645df63251bd96e6cc6a2dc?s=eyJ1IjoiNWU4NDNjYTBiZTBlNjQxODYyZDMwYzUzIiwiZCI6MX0%3D"><span>🥕都市农耕，精神角落…下班后你会选择怎样的生活？</span></a></p>]]></description>
