  <item>
    <title>16. 恋爱的实质是自恋 | 聊聊被“全能自恋”杀死的亲密关系</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e88f6e2d96b6aa8034c33f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e88f6e2d96b6aa8034c33f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Mar 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>失恋差点要了半条命💔。好在活过来了，于是有了这期分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，我是你们的魔都沪漂好朋友👬🏻</span><strong><span>锐言Swear</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是走心的读书分享，武志红老师的新书</span><a href="https://weread.qq.com/web/bookDetail/bb432f60813ab8444g014d61" data-url="https://weread.qq.com/web/bookDetail/bb432f60813ab8444g014d61"><span>《深度关系》</span></a><span>，以</span><strong><span>“全能自恋”</span></strong><span>的视角解读亲密关系中的“冲突与愤怒”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>疯狂读书学习和内省内观是我失恋后自我疗愈和成长的方式，对我很有用。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也许你在经历情感低谷，希望我声音的温度也能对你有用❤️。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">03:28</a> 亲密关系这个社会大难题，清华学霸也不会解！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">07:38</a> 关系破裂的背后是“全能感”的破碎：</span><strong><span>每个人是一个需要被点亮的能量球</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> 从“全能”到“退行”：为什么我们常在亲密关系中常常变成“婴儿”，“低能儿”……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">17:33</a> 生活中无处不在的极端“全能感”：好学生的“卓越强迫症”，讨好者的“强大恐惧症”，老好人的“权威恐惧症”，键盘侠的“投入困难症”……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 破局“全能自恋”困境：用</span><strong><span>人性坐标系</span></strong><span>解释情感高低位的本质</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_rJ-x_kFfZ76rUcClriPP6qWho.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1808">30:08</a> 我们构建亲密关系，是为了自我人性坐标系的圆满</span></p><span></span><p><span>【往期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64876587e68894365d024197" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64876587e68894365d024197"><span>第12期</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/652ec434fe74417292357787" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/652ec434fe74417292357787"><span>第15期</span></a><span>播客分享了</span><strong><span>结婚和离婚</span></strong><span>的</span><strong><span>法律常识</span></strong><span>，更理性，更实用~！爱是流动的，守不住，💰财要牢牢自己把握💪。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Ending Music】 Better me - 薛凯琪</span></p>]]></description>
