  <item>
    <title>14. 反正结了也会离！如何优雅又体面地“再见爱人”？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6511cdf450cf691d24a53039</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6511cdf450cf691d24a53039</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Sep 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《再见爱人3》看了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这夫妻撕逼的伪文艺节目怎么越来越火了？</span></p><span></span><p><span>反正咱也没结婚，放肆聊聊节目观感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 戳中了谁？这届观众讨论亲密关系的热情怎么如此高涨？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">02:31</a> 横看竖看，婚姻就是个筐，什么歪瓜裂枣都敢往里装！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a> 我们以为的“深爱”，原来不过是过往“失望”的不断复现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a> 节目能聊的都是隔靴搔痒，真实的都藏在台面下隐秘角落里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="894">14:54</a> 妇女解放，寿命延长，未来，婚姻制度会消亡吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 放过他人也放过自己吧，不再期望用“婚姻”解决“个人问题”，关系就稳了</span></p><span></span><p><span>【广告时间】</span></p><span></span><p><span>不管结没结婚，都要保持警惕，知识、心态两手抓！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在我的</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64876587e68894365d024197" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64876587e68894365d024197"><span>第12期播客</span></a><span>分享了我的婚姻法科普读物学习笔记：婚姻中，如何界定“我的”房子和“我们的”房产？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果听完你觉得还是婚前单身独立买房安全靠谱，那么你可前往我过往“免责闲侃”系列三部曲（</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62bc9be11f317b0b2450f752" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62bc9be11f317b0b2450f752"><span>I</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62bc9be11f317b0b2450f752" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62bc9be11f317b0b2450f752"><span>II</span></a><span>，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e921b90d7e8eaa7278f4be" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e921b90d7e8eaa7278f4be"><span>III</span></a><span>），其中有我独自完成沪上婚前购房的血泪经验，不聊周期，简单朴素，看了能避坑，能省钱，希望对你们有所帮助！</span></p><span></span><p><span>下期继续分享我的“没有用的知识又增加了——婚姻法小常识”读书笔记。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【STAFF】All by 锐言/Swear7D</span></p><span></span><p><span>【ED音乐】唯一 “COVER” - 邓紫棋</span></p>]]></description>
