  <item>
    <title>12. 婚不是想结就能结，但婚姻法一定要学一学 P1</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64876587e68894365d024197</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64876587e68894365d024197</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Jun 2023 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>之前做了不少买房经验分享，这次来说说婚姻中的房产🏠</span></p><span></span><p><span>【欢迎关注】</span></p><span></span><p><span>💗本节目是大龄沪漂女青年的独白，不定期更新💗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span>找到合适的结婚对象太难了吧🤦‍♀️！</span></p><span></span><p><span>但这还只是开始，要处理好婚姻中的利益问题也不容易。相亲相爱最好，如果有一天分开了，房子会怎么判？收的租金该怎么算💰？</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是我打开了婚姻法书籍，开始笔记。今天来阶段性分享一些书里看来的知识。个人分享，仅供参考，欢迎指正哦^_^</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:27</a> 两个人的决策最难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a> 这年头结婚图什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">04:58</a> 除了领证，还要签订自己版本的婚姻契约</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="496">08:16</a> 有的房产离婚时处置不了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">09:44</a> 婚前房产如何处置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 婚后房产如何处置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> 婚姻存续期房子产生的租金如何处置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 参考书《好的婚姻，守护财产和爱》</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果听完你觉得还是婚前单身独立买房安全靠谱，不妨也回头去听听前面的内容，我分享了一系列沪上买房的经验，希望对你有所帮助！</span></p><span></span><p><span>未来继续分享经验心得。未雨绸缪是因为认真对待，是为了更好地关系经营❤️（已更新～可以跳转至</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/652ec434fe74417292357787" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/652ec434fe74417292357787"><span>最新一期</span></a><span>收听更完整的知识分享）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎友爱讨论，祝大家都幸福美满💐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【STAFF】All by 锐言/Swear7D</span></p><span></span><p><span>【ED音乐】Letting Go - 蔡健雅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqrMHV2nnUvdUyCMf6TJ-xf_77Ht.m4a" length="22324852" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:22:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Zod09zNmtZZVprMkZUWUR3bDl6ak1TN1FMdTAucG5n.png"/>
